From: Jayesh Rathod <jayesh4.rathod@ril.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 15:09:16 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 10/14] Add the Penny & Microcap Shadow Telegram route and
 setup guide

Provisions the fourth bot so it can be created and validated before the penny
scanner is wired to it. The scanner's strategy logic is maintained separately and
is not touched here.

penny_shadow/telegram.py
  Fail-closed delivery on PENNY_* secrets, following the per-scanner pattern in
  docs/TELEGRAM_THREE_BOT_ROUTING.md. A missing credential returns
  penny_telegram_credentials_missing and delivers nothing; it never falls back to
  the V3, Ladder or Hull bot, which is asserted -- a penny card must not surface
  in a large-cap topic. Six topics, split by stage rather than by report, so the
  radar firehose can be muted without losing entry authorisations. Messages over
  Telegram's 4,096-character limit split on card boundaries so a card is never
  truncated mid-way. preflight() reports which secrets are visible without
  printing any value.

penny_shadow/cards.py
  Renders the four specified sections -- Radar, Confirming, Ready, Circuit Risk
  -- from plain dictionaries, so it does not depend on the scanner's internals.
  Matches the specification's card layout exactly. Two deliberate properties:

  * Missing evidence is stated, never invented. An absent delivery percentage
    reads "Not yet confirmed" rather than 0.0%, and an unverified market cap
    reads "UNVERIFIED -- observation only".
  * A symbol carrying a circuit or terminal availability state routes to Circuit
    Risk and never to Ready, whatever it scored. NHCFOODS therefore stays
    detected, scored 82/100, and visibly unbuyable -- the behaviour the
    specification asks for.

scripts/penny_telegram_smoke.py
  Proves the token, chat and each topic work using sample cards in the real
  format, so a formatting or permission problem surfaces before a live run.
  Dry run by default.

docs/PENNY_TELEGRAM_BOT_SETUP.md
  Nine steps from @BotFather to a scheduled workflow, including the getUpdates
  and Copy-Link methods for chat and topic IDs, the four common Telegram errors
  and their causes, how to apply the shared gateway with the penny-specific
  allowance for an unverified market cap at EARLY RADAR, and token rotation.

docs/TELEGRAM_THREE_BOT_ROUTING.md is updated from three bots to four.

Tests: 27 new. Suite 411 passed, same 7 pre-existing failures.
